{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1305","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Kuroni and Impossible Calculation"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To become the king of Codeforces, Kuroni has to solve the following problem."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"He is given $$$n$$$ numbers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$. Help Kuroni to calculate $$$\\prod_{1\\le i \\lt j\\le n} |a_i - a_j|$$$. As result can be very big, output it modulo $$$m$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If you are not familiar with short notation, $$$\\prod_{1\\le i \\lt j\\le n} |a_i - a_j|$$$ is equal to $$$|a_1 - a_2|\\cdot|a_1 - a_3|\\cdot$$$ $$$\\dots$$$ $$$\\cdot|a_1 - a_n|\\cdot|a_2 - a_3|\\cdot|a_2 - a_4|\\cdot$$$ $$$\\dots$$$ $$$\\cdot|a_2 - a_n| \\cdot$$$ $$$\\dots$$$ $$$\\cdot |a_{n-1} - a_n|$$$. In other words, this is the product of $$$|a_i - a_j|$$$ for all $$$1\\le i \\lt j \\le n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers $$$n$$$, $$$m$$$ ($$$2\\le n \\le 2\\cdot 10^5$$$, $$$1\\le m \\le 1000$$$) — number of numbers and modulo."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ ($$$0 \\le a_i \\le 10^9$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output the single number — $$$\\prod_{1\\le i \\lt j\\le n} |a_i - a_j| \\bmod m$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2 10\n8 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 12\n1 4 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n0"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 7\n1 4 9\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample, $$$|8 - 5| = 3 \\equiv 3 \\bmod 10$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second sample, $$$|1 - 4|\\cdot|1 - 5|\\cdot|4 - 5| = 3\\cdot 4 \\cdot 1 = 12 \\equiv 0 \\bmod 12$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third sample, $$$|1 - 4|\\cdot|1 - 9|\\cdot|4 - 9| = 3 \\cdot 8 \\cdot 5 = 120 \\equiv 1 \\bmod 7$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"1305C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1305/problem/C"}